  "ruleText": "Rev 1406.04 Form PA-20-EXT, “Request for Extension to File Utility Property Tax Information Update.” A utility requesting an extension to file Form PA-20 shall complete and file Form PA-20-EXT, “Request for Extension to File Utility Property Tax Information Update,” with the department on or before May 1.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev1400) #9841, eff 12-23-10; ss by #12706, eff 1-8-19",
